# The pipeline driver scripts are POSIX shell and are executed by bash inside
# the Docker image and under WSL / Linux. They must keep LF endings on every
# platform: on a Windows checkout `core.autocrlf=true` (the Git for Windows
# default) would otherwise rewrite them to CRLF, and bash then fails with
# e.g. "set: pipefail: invalid option name".
*.sh text eol=lf
